<!-- ══════════════════ HEADER ══════════════════ -->
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div class="header-badge">UNODC · Policy Analysis Report</div>
    <h1>Global Intentional Homicide Trends<br>A Multi-Dimensional Analysis (1990–2023)</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A comprehensive examination of intentional homicide rates across 201 countries, disaggregated by sex and age group, to inform evidence-based public safety policy.</p>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <span>&#128197; Generated: April 21, 2026</span>
      <span>&#128202; Data: UNODC Crime Trends Survey (CTS)</span>
      <span>&#127758; 201 Countries &amp; Territories</span>
      <span>&#128337; 1990–2023 (34 Years)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════ KPI DASHBOARD ══════════════════ -->
<div class="kpi-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="kpi-label">&#9650; Executive KPI Dashboard — Key Indicators at a Glance</div>
    <div class="kpi-grid">

      <div class="kpi-card blue">
        <div class="kpi-name">Global Median Rate (2023)</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">1.84</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">per 100,000 population — 84 countries reporting</div>
        <div class="kpi-trend">&#8595; Down from 3.96 in the 1990s</div>
      </div>

      <div class="kpi-card red">
        <div class="kpi-name">Highest National Rate (2023)</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">64.2</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Saint Kitts and Nevis — 35× the global median</div>
        <div class="kpi-trend">&#8593; Up 579% since 1995</div>
      </div>

      <div class="kpi-card green">
        <div class="kpi-name">Decade-over-Decade Change</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">&#8722;41%</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Global median: 3.96 (1990s) → 2.35 (2020s)</div>
        <div class="kpi-trend">Sustained downward trajectory since 2000</div>
      </div>

      <div class="kpi-card amber">
        <div class="kpi-name">Male-to-Female Ratio (2023)</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">2.61×</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Males killed at 2.61× the rate of females</div>
        <div class="kpi-trend">Modest improvement from 3.47× avg in 1990s</div>
      </div>

      <div class="kpi-card slate">
        <div class="kpi-name">Reporting Coverage</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">84–162</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Countries/year (sex='both', age_group='ALL')</div>
        <div class="kpi-trend">Peak: 162 countries (2008); 2023 data still arriving</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════ TOC ══════════════════ -->
<div class="container">
  <div class="toc">
    <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><a href="#global-overview">Global Homicide Rate Overview (1990–2023)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#regional-comparison">Regional &amp; Country-Level Comparison</a></li>
      <li><a href="#sex-disparity">Gender Disparity in Homicide Victimization</a></li>
      <li><a href="#age-group-analysis">Age Group Analysis</a></li>
      <li><a href="#notable-trends">Notable Country-Level Trends &amp; Outliers</a></li>
      <li><a href="#data-limitations">Data Limitations &amp; Policy Recommendations</a></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════ SECTION 1: GLOBAL OVERVIEW ══════════════════ -->
<div class="container">
  <div class="section" id="global-overview">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-number">Section 01</div>
      <h2>Global Homicide Rate Overview (1990–2023)</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Analysis of the global median and mean homicide rates over three decades, covering 201 countries and territories. Filtered to <code>sex='both'</code>, <code>age_group='ALL'</code> for comparability.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="callout success">
      <strong>Headline Finding</strong>
      The world has become measurably safer from intentional homicide over the past three decades. The global median rate has declined from approximately 3.96 (per 100,000) in the 1990s to 2.35 in the 2020s — a reduction of roughly 41%. The linear regression slope of the annual median is &minus;0.063 per year, confirming a statistically consistent downward trend.
    </div>

    <!-- Time-series chart: median rate -->
    <div class="chart-card">
      <div class="chart-title">Global Median and Mean Intentional Homicide Rate, 1990–2023</div>
      <div class="chart-subtitle">Per 100,000 population · sex='both', age_group='ALL' · Source: UNODC CTS</div>
      <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:340px;">
        <canvas id="globalTrendChart"></canvas>
      </div>
